' A key held through another scene (`preset classic|extended ai none seed 3
' start 30`). The right arrow held 1000 ms in Paradise Camp; five frames in, R
' opens INFO, which takes the scene for about twenty frames — he does not
' walk under it — then its map button closes it and he walks on while the
' key is down: the save has him at 148,160, not the 188 of a walk that went
' on under INFO.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
holdkey right 1000
wait 5
press r                  ' INFO
wait 20
sceneclick 20,185        ' back
wait 60
save                     ' 148,160
quit
